e manufacture and sale of antacids therapeutic category of active pharmaceutical ingredients (API) in India and internationally. It offers antacid API, such as aluminum hydroxide gel, magnesium hydroxide, magaldrate, magnesium trisilicate, magnesium silicate, aluminum phosphate; and technical backup support services. The company also provides aluminum hydroxide gel low heavy lead content, product for lake color; aluminum hydroxide amorphous, aluminum sulphate, poly aluminum chloride for water treatment and aluminum salts applications; and organic API intermediate and dyes intermediate. It offers its products in various forms, including paste, powder, and micronized grade powder. The company serves the pharmaceutical, food, and chemical industries. It also exports its products. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is based in Hyderabad, India. Vasundhara Rasayans Limited is a subsidiary of P&J Cretechem Private Limited."}}